Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Seats: prorated seat changes, billing page control,
 nightly audit

## Acceptance criteria
- [ ] An owner adds a seat from the billing page and is charged the prorated difference
- [ ] Removing a seat never charges the card
- [ ] Seat counts outside 1 to 500 are refused
- [ ] The nightly audit emails the owner when members exceed paid seats
- [ ] Another tenant can never change your seats
